msgid "物理层详解"
msgstr "Physical Layer Details"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:3
msgid ""
"本文详细解释 SparkLink SLE 物理层的设计与实现, 覆盖调制波形、帧结构、信道编码和收发流水线, 逐一对标 "
"TXS-10002-2025 标准条款并说明代码中的实现方式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:5
msgid "调制方式"
msgstr "Modulation Schemes"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:7
msgid "SLE 物理层支持两大类调制: 频移键控 (GFSK) 和相移键控 (PSK), 分别用于不同帧类型。"
msgstr "The SLE physical layer supports two main modulation categories: frequency shift keying (GFSK) and phase shift keying (PSK), used for different frame types."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:9
msgid "GFSK 调制 (§6.2.1.1)"
msgstr "GFSK Modulation (§6.2.1.1)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:11
msgid "高斯频移键控是 FT1 帧的唯一调制方式。标准规定:"
msgstr "Gaussian frequency shift keying is the only modulation scheme for FT1 frames. The standard specifies:"

