#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:85
msgid "帧结构 (§6.3)"
msgstr "Frame Structure (§6.3)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:87
msgid "无线帧的组成"
msgstr "Wireless Frame Composition"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:89
msgid "每个物理帧由帧头和数据两部分构成:"
msgstr "Each physical frame consists of a header and data portion:"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:97
msgid "各帧类型的差异集中在帧头的编码和调制方式上:"
msgstr "Differences between frame types are mainly in the header's coding and modulation schemes:"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:99
msgid "FT1 — 广播帧 (§6.3.2)"
msgstr "FT1 — Broadcast Frame (§6.3.2)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:101
msgid "**前导码**: GFSK, [0,1] 交替, 10 $\\mu$s"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:102
msgid "**同步序列**: sync_signal_1, 32 位→32 个 GFSK 符号"
msgstr "**Sync sequence**: sync_signal_1, 32-bit → 32 GFSK symbols"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:103
msgid "**控制信息**: A 组, 无 Polar 编码, GFSK 调制"
msgstr "**Control info**: Group A, no Polar coding, GFSK modulation"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:104
msgid "**载荷**: 不经 Polar 编码, 直接 GFSK 调制"
msgstr "**Payload**: no Polar coding, directly GFSK modulated"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:105
msgid "**典型用途**: 广播、发现、接入请求/响应"
msgstr "**Typical use**: broadcast, discovery, access request/response"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:107
msgid "FT1 是最轻量的帧类型, 没有前向纠错编码开销。控制信息头部用 BCH 码保护, CRC 种子由同步序列低位确定。"
msgstr "FT1 is the lightest frame type with no forward error correction coding overhead. The control information header is protected by BCH code; the CRC seed is determined by the lower bits of the sync sequence."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:109
msgid "FT2 — 短头数据帧 (§6.3.3)"
msgstr "FT2 — Short-Header Data Frame (§6.3.3)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:111
msgid "**前导码**: PSK, [$\\pi/4$, 0] 交替, 10 $\\mu$s"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:112
msgid "**同步序列**: sync_signal_2, 64 位→32 个 QPSK 符号"
msgstr "**Sync sequence**: sync_signal_2, 64-bit → 32 QPSK symbols"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:113
msgid "**控制信息**: A 组, Polar(64,K) 编码→32 QPSK 符号, 导频间隔 16"
msgstr "**Control info**: Group A, Polar(64,K) coded → 32 QPSK symbols, pilot interval 16"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:114
msgid "**载荷**: 码块分割 (无段内 CRC) → Polar 编码 → PSK 调制 + 导频"
msgstr "**Payload**: code block segmentation (no intra-segment CRC) → Polar coding → PSK modulation + pilots"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:115
msgid "**导频**: 可选, 间隔 4/8/16"
msgstr "**Pilots**: optional, interval 4/8/16"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:117
msgid "FT3 — 长头数据帧 (§6.3.4)"
msgstr "FT3 — Long-Header Data Frame (§6.3.4)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:119
msgid "**前导码**: PSK, [$\\pi/4$, 0] 交替, 12 $\\mu$s"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:120
msgid "**同步序列**: sync_signal_3, 31+31 位→62 个 BPSK 符号 (基于 m31 序列)"
msgstr "**Sync sequence**: sync_signal_3, 31+31 bits → 62 BPSK symbols (based on m31 sequence)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:121
msgid "**控制信息**: B 组, Polar(256,K)→128 QPSK 符号, 导频间隔 4"
msgstr "**Control info**: Group B, Polar(256,K) → 128 QPSK symbols, pilot interval 4"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:122
msgid "**载荷**: 码块分割 (含段内 CRC) → Polar 编码 → PSK 调制 + 导频"
msgstr "**Payload**: code block segmentation (with intra-segment CRC) → Polar coding → PSK modulation + pilots"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:123
msgid "**特点**: B 组 CRC 种子 = `0x555555 ^ LLID`"
msgstr "**Feature**: Group B CRC seed = `0x555555 ^ LLID`"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:125
msgid "FT4 — 扩展头数据帧 (§6.3.5)"
msgstr "FT4 — Extended-Header Data Frame (§6.3.5)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:127
msgid "**前导码**: PSK, [$\\pi/4$, 0] 交替, 16 $\\mu$s"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:128
msgid "**同步序列**: sync_signal_4, 63+63 位→126 个 BPSK 符号 (基于 m63 序列)"
msgstr "**Sync sequence**: sync_signal_4, 63+63 bits → 126 BPSK symbols (based on m63 sequence)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:129
msgid "**控制信息**: B 组, Polar(256,K)→256 BPSK 符号, 导频间隔 4"
msgstr "**Control info**: Group B, Polar(256,K) → 256 BPSK symbols, pilot interval 4"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:130
msgid "**载荷**: 与 FT3 相同的编码方案, 但同步序列更长, 适合低信噪比场景"
msgstr "**Payload**: same coding scheme as FT3, but longer sync sequence, suitable for low SNR scenarios"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:132
msgid "时序参数"
msgstr "Timing Parameters"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"系统基础时隙 $T_{sys} = 125\\,\\mu s$, 由 30 位计数器表示当前时刻。调度时隙有 25/50/75/100/125 "
"$\\mu$s 五种选择。帧的空口时长由以下公式决定:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:136
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"T_{frame} = T_{preamble} + T_{sync} + T_{ctrl} + T_{data} + T_{guard}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:140
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `phy.frame` 模块的 `_SYNC_CONFIG` 和 `_CTRL_CONFIG` "
"字典定义了四种帧类型的完整参数。`assemble_frame_bits()` 生成比特级帧结构, `frame_to_symbols()` "
"完成到调制符号的转换。"
msgstr ""

