msgstr "Physical Layer Control Information (§6.4)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:144
msgid "控制信息是帧头中紧跟同步序列之后的结构化字段, 携带帧类型、载荷长度、MCS 等元信息。"
msgstr "Control information is the structured field immediately following the sync sequence in the frame header, carrying frame type, payload length, MCS, and other metadata."

