msgid "**代码实现**: `phy.preamble.generate_preamble()` 函数根据帧类型自动选择波形和时长。"
msgstr "**Code implementation**: `phy.preamble.generate_preamble()` function automatically selects waveform and duration based on frame type."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:198
msgid "导频 (§6.7)"
msgstr "Pilots (§6.7)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:200
msgid "导频符号是已知相位的参考符号, 周期性插入数据符号流中, 用于接收端进行信道估计和相位跟踪。"
msgstr "Pilot symbols are reference symbols with known phase, periodically inserted into the data symbol stream for channel estimation and phase tracking at the receiver."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:202
msgid "导频相位与该调制阶数的标准相位一致: BPSK 90°, QPSK 45°, 8PSK 22.5°。偶数位导频执行与数据符号相同的额外旋转。"
msgstr "Pilot phase is aligned with the standard phase for the modulation order: BPSK 90°, QPSK 45°, 8PSK 22.5°. Even-position pilots undergo the same additional rotation as data symbols."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:204
msgid "插入规则: 每 $N$ 个数据符号后插入 1 个导频, $N$ 可选 4/8/16。帧末尾的导频可省略。"
msgstr "Insertion rule: 1 pilot inserted after every $N$ data symbols; $N$ can be 4/8/16. Pilots at the end of the frame may be omitted."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:206
msgid "FT1 不使用导频。FT2 导频可选 (默认间隔 16)。FT3/FT4 强制使用导频 (默认间隔 4)。"
msgstr "FT1 does not use pilots. FT2 pilots are optional (default interval 16). FT3/FT4 mandate pilots (default interval 4)."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:208
msgid "**代码实现**: `phy.pilot.insert_pilots()` 和 `remove_pilots()` 函数。"
msgstr "**Code implementation**: `phy.pilot.insert_pilots()` and `remove_pilots()` functions."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:210
msgid "信道编码 (§6.9-6.11)"
msgstr "Channel Coding (§6.9-6.11)"

