msgstr "Payload segment, Group B"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md
msgid "CRC24B"
msgstr "CRC24B"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md
msgid "(同 24A 不同多项式)"
msgstr "(different polynomial from 24A)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md
msgid "码块分割段内 CRC"
msgstr "Code block segmentation intra-segment CRC"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md
msgid "CRC32"
msgstr "CRC32"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md
msgid "标准 CRC-32"
msgstr "Standard CRC-32"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md
msgid "长载荷"
msgstr "Long payload"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:223
msgid "CRC 计算支持种子值, A 组种子来自同步序列, B 组种子 = `0x555555 ^ LLID`。"
msgstr "CRC computation supports seed values; Group A seed comes from the sync sequence, Group B seed = `0x555555 ^ LLID`."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:225
msgid "**代码实现**: `common.crc.crc_calculate()`, 支持 Rust 加速 (`_HAS_RUST_CRC` 自动检测)。"
msgstr "**Code implementation**: `common.crc.crc_calculate()`, with Rust acceleration support (`_HAS_RUST_CRC` auto-detected)."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:227
msgid "Polar 编码 (§6.10.1)"
msgstr "Polar Coding (§6.10.1)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:229
msgid "SLE 的前向纠错采用 Polar 码, 核心参数:"
msgstr "SLE uses Polar codes for forward error correction with the following core parameters:"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:231
msgid "母码长度 $N$: 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024"
msgstr "Mother code length $N$: 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:232
msgid "信息位数 $K$: 由 MCS 索引和载荷长度决定"
msgstr "Information bit count $K$: determined by MCS index and payload length"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:233
msgid "可靠性序列: 标准附录 C 给出 1024 阶固定排序"
msgstr "Reliability sequence: standard Appendix C provides 1024-level fixed ordering"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:235
msgid "编码器执行蝶形 GF(2) 变换, 解码器采用逐次消除 (SC) 算法, 辅以 SSC 剪枝 (rate-0/rate-1 子树快速路径)。"
msgstr "The encoder performs butterfly GF(2) transform; the decoder uses successive cancellation (SC) algorithm with SSC pruning (fast paths for rate-0/rate-1 subtrees)."

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:237
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `common.polar.PolarEncoder` / `PolarDecoder`, 均支持 Rust 加速 (PyO3"
" 扩展 `nearlink_sdr_accel`)。编码加速约 10 倍, 解码加速约 10 倍。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:239
msgid "码块分割 (§6.10.2)"
msgstr "Code Block Segmentation (§6.10.2)"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:241
msgid "当载荷超过单个 Polar 码块容量时, 进行码块分割:"
msgstr "When payload exceeds a single Polar code block capacity, code block segmentation is performed:"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:243
msgid "**无段内 CRC** (FT2): 载荷等分为多个码块, 每块独立 Polar 编码"
msgstr "**Without intra-segment CRC** (FT2): payload evenly divided into multiple code blocks, each independently Polar-coded"

#: ../../explanation/physical-layer.md:244
msgid "**含段内 CRC** (FT3/FT4): 每个码块附加额外 CRC, 增强可靠性"
msgstr "**With intra-segment CRC** (FT3/FT4): each code block has an additional CRC appended, enhancing reliability"

